  "contentHtml": "<p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9924634E5B9332A601\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"690\" height=\"342\" style=\"width: 690px; height: 342px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"택시사진.jpg\"  id=\"A_9924634E5B9332A601CE63\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\">학교 운동장을 택시들이 점령해버렸습니다.</p><p style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\">미리내일학교의 직업체험처를 방문하기 위한 교통수단으로 택시와 버스가 운동장에서</p><p style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\">학생들을 맞이하고 있습니다.</p><p style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\">미리내일학교 : 학생들이 관공서,기업,기업체, 개인사업 장 등에서 희망분야의 직업을 직접 체험함으로써 구체적인 진로설계를&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\">할 수 있도록 지원하는 프로그램</p><p style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 24px; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\">등교하는 학생들의 이야기를 들었습니다.</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">‘</span>학교에 택시가 왔네<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">.&nbsp;</span>아 미리내일학교 구나<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">(</span>학생들이 체험활동이름을 기억하네<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">!)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\">학생에게 질문&nbsp;<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">:&nbsp;</span>몇 학년인가요<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">? 3</span>학년입니다<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\">미리내학교 어땠어요<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">?</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\">또 가고 싶어요!</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 24px; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><br></p><table style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; border-right-color: currentColor; border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-left-color: currentColor; border-right-width: medium; border-bottom-width: medium; border-left-width: medium; border-right-style: none; border-bottom-style: none; border-left-style: none; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(224, 238, 209); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 116px; height: 62.09pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: -134.8pt; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; margin-left: 134.8pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">단계</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: -134.8pt; font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; margin-left: 134.8pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">사전교육</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 595px; height: 62.09pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\" colspan=\"3\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 7pt; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">직업세계의 이해</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">직업체험의 필요성</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">체험할 직업에 대한 사전지식 습득</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">직업체험처 예절</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">안전교육 등</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt medium; border-style: solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor; padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 442.26pt; height: 20.82pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\" colspan=\"4\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: -192.2pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt; margin-left: 192.2pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">&#61674;</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(224, 238, 209); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 116px; height: 187.65pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\" rowspan=\"9\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: -192.2pt; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; margin-left: 192.2pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">단계</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: -192.2pt; font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; margin-left: 192.2pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">직업체험</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt; border-style: solid solid dotted; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 595px; height: 62.09pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\" colspan=\"3\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 12px; font-size: 7pt; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">현장에서 체험을 통한 직업탐색</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">직업인과의 인터뷰를 통한 실질적인 정보 습득</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">진로도달경로 파악 등</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(239, 246, 231); border-width: 0.28pt; border-style: dotted solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 595px; height: 15.82pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\" colspan=\"3\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">심리상담사 체험&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">예시</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(239, 246, 231); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 297px; height: 15.82pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">시간</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(239, 246, 231); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 64.27pt; height: 15.82pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">소요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">분</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(239, 246, 231); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 222.77pt; height: 15.82pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">일정</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5