ily: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">90</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 222.77pt; height: 15.82pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">놀이치료</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">미술치료</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">음악치료 체험</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 297px; height: 14.82pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">12:10~12:30</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 64.27pt; height: 14.82pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">20</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 222.77pt; height: 14.82pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">멘토 인터뷰</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt medium; border-style: solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor; padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 442.26pt; height: 21.31pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\" colspan=\"4\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: -192.2pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt; margin-left: 192.2pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">&#61674;</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(224, 238, 209); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 116px; height: 69.89pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: -134.8pt; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; margin-left: 134.8pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">단계</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; text-indent: -134.8pt; font-size: 7pt; font-weight: bold; margin-left: 134.8pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">사후활동</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); border-image: none; width: 595px; height: 69.89pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\" colspan=\"3\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 7pt; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">직업인 멘토에게 감사엽서 쓰기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">미래 시나리오 작성</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">진로 설계도 작성 등&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\">1. 학부모진로코치 양성</p><p style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;1, 2, 3단계 모두 학부모강사님들이 진행하십니다.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; -ms-word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;(학부모강사들은 사전교육을 받습니다)</p><table style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; border-right-color: currentColor; border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-left-color: currentColor; border-right-width: medium; border-bottom-width: medium; border-left-width: medium; border-right-style: none; border-bottom-style: none; border-left-style: none; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(224, 238, 209); border-width: 0.28pt 0.28pt 0.28pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor; padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 104.02pt; height: 24.31pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">교육과정</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"background: rgb(224, 238, 209); border-width: 0.28pt medium 0.28pt 0.28pt; border-style: solid none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 343.88pt; height: 24.31pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\" colspan=\"2\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">교육시간</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt 0.28pt 0.28pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor; padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 104.02pt; height: 47.94pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">학부모 진로코치</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">양성과정</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">[</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">중급</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">]</span></p></td><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt medium 0.28pt 0.28pt; border-style: solid none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; width: 343.88pt; height: 47.94pt; font-family: 굴림, gulim, tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\" colspan=\"2\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; -ms-word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">12</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">시간</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">이론교육</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-width: 0.28pt 0.28pt 0.28pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentColor; padding: 1.